    "probe": "ransom-note",
    "target": "Jamie Reid lineage: one slogan cut letter by letter out of other printed matter, mismatched size and face, torn edges, overprint",
    "method": "each letter is a group: an offset misprint patch, a torn-edge polygon in cut-paper colour, and one text op. Torn edges are hand-authored 14-point polygons -- real hard-edged geometry, not an effect. Mismatched face is only two faces (PT Sans and PT Serif, both Regular), so mismatch is carried almost entirely by size and rotation."
  },
